        "top": 400
      }
    }
  },
  "annotation_notes": "Workflow Logic: 1) SENTIEON_TNSCOPE processes BAM file with reference and germline resources across intervals. 2) Output VCFs are branched based on num_intervals metadata. 3) If num_intervals > 1, VCFs are merged using MERGE_TNSCOPE with dict file. 4) Final outputs combine merged VCFs (multi-interval) and unmerged VCFs (single-interval) with variantcaller metadata added."
